## 🔍 Monitoring indicators

- Thread pool starvation with low CPU usage
- Random deadlocks during peak traffic
- Response times grow exponentially with load
- Silent failures without proper exception logging

Remember: async isn't just syntax—it's how we handle I/O efficiently to maximize throughput and minimize resource usage.
